---
description: Expo Go compatibility
alwaysApply: true
---
- Dev runs in Expo Go. Only use packages bundled in Expo Go for the current SDK. Run `npx expo install <pkg>` so versions match.
- If a feature needs a custom native module, stop and ask before adding it.
- Check docs for the project's installed SDK version before using any API; native tabs and Expo UI APIs differ between SDK versions.
